 "description": "Zhu2015 - Combined gemcitabine and birinapant in pancreatic cancer cells - mechanistic PD model\nBioModels BIOMD0000000669 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000669_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100 time units (SED-ML: MODEL1604270001_mechanistic.sedml), sampling 1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 5.44e-06 of species peak (worst: G1)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] species 'R_total' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'R_live' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] rate rule dS/dt term 3: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - S1: zero order, signed\n  [info] rate rule dS/dt term 4: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - S1: zero order, signed\n  [info] rate rule dS/dt term 5: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [partial] event times do not fit a practical sampling grid; events fire up to one sampling interval (1) late\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): S1 = S",
